    echr:hasSupportingQuote "**20.** On 23 November 2007 the applicant company lodged a complaint concerning the decision to leave the claim and counterclaim unexamined. It argued, inter alia , that the agreements signed on 28 October 2005 ... provided that disputes ... would be determined by the courts."^^xsd:string ;
    echr:participatingParty doc:partyScholzAg .

